SUMMARY:Literary Debates: A Dialogue of Thought and the Art of Persuasion
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an enriching session where we explore literary debate\, its concept and objectives\, and learn the foundations of building compelling literary arguments. We will also develop persuasion and audience engagement skills\, while highlighting the ethics of debate and the etiquette of dialogue that foster thoughtful discussions\, enrich ideas and celebrate diverse perspectives.
